  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposal, because of its position, size, scale and appearance, within a prominent corner plot, would constitute a bulky and obtrusive feature that harms the appearance and character of the original house, the adjacent footway, the surrounding gardens and the area as a whole. It results in a poor and overbearing outlook for neighbours and a loss of daylight, harmful to their living conditions. The proposal therefore fails to meet adopted Unitary Development Plan Policies ENV-B.1.1 (All New Development) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations), and the Council's Residential Extension Guidelines."
